title: The Frankfurt Congress
subtitle: The Ninth Party Congress decides who leads the KPD after the defeat.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1924 and month >= 4 and rf_over = 0
max-visits: 1

= The Ninth Party Congress, Frankfurt

The congress meets in Frankfurt in April 1924. The party has lost members, money and its illusions. Most delegates are angry, and the anger runs to the left. Zinoviev's representatives are in the hall.

[? if player_leads : You hold the Zentrale. Your opponents have spent the winter organising against you. ?][? if player_leads = 0 : This is your chance to take the party. ?]

- @fight: Throw everything into the delegate fight.
- @deal: Make a deal with another faction for a shared leadership.
- @moscow: Let Moscow's representatives know you will follow the ECCI's line.

@fight
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 6;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.player) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 4; }
}
!}
go-to: result

@deal
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 3;
Q.center_strength += 3;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 5; }
Q.shared_leadership = 1;
!}
go-to: result

@moscow
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 10;
Q.autonomy -= 5;
!}
go-to: result

@result
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.normalize(Q);
window.RF.congress(Q);
Q.rf_over = 1;
Q.rf_ending = 'frankfurt';
!}

= The vote

[? if congress_compromise : No faction commands a majority. The congress elects the Middle Group as a compromise leadership. ?][? if congress_compromise = 0 : The delegates give the [+ congress_winner_name +] the majority. ?]

[? if moscow_overruled : The Comintern's representatives refuse to accept the result. Moscow's choice, the [+ leader_name +], forms the new Zentrale. ?]
